{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id1913063701"}, "name":{"label":"Tom70707"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-04-21T03:30:40-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"5.2.1"}, "id":{"label":"13981179506"}, "title":{"label":"Best so far !"}, "content":{"label":"I have used many different screen time apps for instagram but this is the best so far. First of all, I still get notifications, I can still phone call even after my limit has finished, I can set a time depending on if I’m making a post or accidentally doomscrolling. And the best thing is when I do meet my time limit set, instead of asking if I want to open it again straight away, it makes you take a deep breath. Most of the time this makes me put my phone down anyway. \n\nLove it !", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=1532875441&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
