{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id41975205"}, "name":{"label":"Emus4eva"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-11-17T05:11:06-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"5.0.5"}, "id":{"label":"13408912566"}, "title":{"label":"Bit buggy"}, "content":{"label":"It’s a great idea but doesn’t quite behave how it’s supposed to. When you select how much time you need on an app after an intervention, the next intervention will sometimes trigger after a couple of minutes when you’ve selected a much longer time. Stats tell me I’ve tried to open Instagram once in the last day, then the next time I open it tells me I’ve tried to open it 20 times. Tells you have much time you’ve “saved” (how is this calculated?) but doesn’t say how much time I’ve spent on the app? The “always ask” intervention doesn’t work at all, it’s just a blank screen. Downloaded to try it out and see if I want to buy the full version. Probably won’t now if it’s going to be this glitchy.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=1532875441&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
