{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id817662372"}, "name":{"label":"yvonzo"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-06-18T03:42:33-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.1.5"}, "id":{"label":"12788262489"}, "title":{"label":"App keeps crashing, so no other apps work either"}, "content":{"label":"Hey there - this intervention app has really taken things up a notch! I’m struggling to even report a problem because the app crashes upon opening, but writing a report via AppStore then sends me to a browsing app that then triggers this one to open… and then crash. I can’t open any apps that I have interventions set for because I can’t get to the intervention stage. Is there anything I can do besides uninstall? as soon as I go into the app it crashes.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=1532875441&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
