{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id808131051"}, "name":{"label":"IoMoCool"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-06-02T00:00:08-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.1.1"}, "id":{"label":"12726322050"}, "title":{"label":"Amazingly helpful"}, "content":{"label":"Ive tried a lot of focus apps before but only onesec was able to help properly because it had much more strict systems that were also FREE. Please never change! This app has helped me a tonne and I plan to use it for the foreseeable future!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=1532875441&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id987246549"}, "name":{"label":"Ry rosehshshs"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-05-23T21:42:57-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.0.12"}, "id":{"label":"12691121776"}, "title":{"label":"Love it….but!"}, "content":{"label":"I love this app, it’s everything i needed to stop me doom scrolling into oblivion. The only problem is, is when you want to block out those apps for anything longer than 15hours like 24hours it doesn’t work. And you cannot go back into the app to try again. So you then have all your apps open when you wanted them locked out. I’ve tried support but not much help here. If you have an issue with doing more than 15 hours then don’t offer it. If they fixed this I’d give 5 stars. I’d also love if you could use on iPads and cross platforms, not that you need to pay for each platform. Express vpn for example you can use on laptop, iPad, iPhone.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=1532875441&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
