{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id966985293"}, "name":{"label":"Alex_kammy"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-04-10T20:07:54-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"4.0.12"}, "id":{"label":"12528633459"}, "title":{"label":"Wow!"}, "content":{"label":"I don’t usually write reviews, but this app has done a tremendous job in such a tiny amount of time! I’ve only had this set for Instagram for about 2 weeks and my scrolling has gone from an average of 4 hours a day to under 1 hour!! Nothing has ever worked for me before and I usually give up after about 2 days so this is huge for me. \nAlso I’m noticing that I actively strive to get less clicks, like at the beginning it would be 50+ tries, but now I keep saying “let’s try to get less than 40/30/20” etc, and now I got less than 10 in 24 hours!\nThank you guys :)", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=1532875441&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
