{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/reviews/id596032055"}, "name":{"label":"DellyBella"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-07-07T17:05:12-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.2.2"}, "id":{"label":"11467737490"}, "title":{"label":"So useful and easy to use"}, "content":{"label":"I love one sec, I have it on my phone and my laptop, its just so useful! I love that it doesn't fully lock my device, just forces me to pause before mindlessly scrolling; it makes me reflect on whether thats what I really want to do without restricting me from accessing apps if I really need to use them. Definitely recommend, as its free and easy, and on your phone the paid version is not necessary, but if you do get it it is affordable and adds some cool extra features (but again, not ecessary). I love one sec, its just such a perfect app that gives you extra super-customisable features that Apple's \"Screen Time\" just does not have. Worth a try if you're on the fence, and they have heaps of really clear tutorials on how to set it up.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/au/review?id=1532875441&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"2"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"2"}}, 
